    "title": "Stories of men who drug and abuse their wives are all too common - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Rowan Pelling ,\n17 hours ago At a time of year when our natural focus is on light and joy, come allegations that look set to disquiet the national psyche. Philip Young, a 49-year-old former Conservative councillor, has appeared at Swindon magistrates’ court and has been charged with 56 sexual offences, including multiple counts of rape and administering a substance with an “intent to stupefy” his ex-wife, 48-year-old Joanne Young, who has waived her right to anonymity. Five other men have also been accused and charged with sexually assaulting Young’s wife over a 13-year period, while she was drugged. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
